{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13224220","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13224220","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322422001:1":{"text":"실례합니다! 혹시 어디서 위대한 의지에 대해 알게 되셨나요?","source_cn":"劳驾！请问你在哪里得知伟大意志的呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C7BB27043C4F083","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322422002:1":{"text":"어디서 알게 되었냐니, 시더 마을을 좀 둘러봐요. 모두가 그 이야기를 하고 있잖아요. 귀를 막아도 진정한 신의 목소리가 들려온다고요.","source_cn":"在哪里得知？瞧瞧现在的雪松镇上吧，所有人都在议论，就算...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2EA8432FC10D4BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322422003:1":{"text":"하지만... 대체 어디서 처음 들었더라...","source_cn":"不过……到底是在哪里得知的来着？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA76888ACAF9160E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322422004:1":{"text":"어쨌든, 당신들은 누구죠? 그런 건 왜 물어요? 알려준다고 뭐가 달라지나요? 흥, 감히 신을 의심하면서 엿보려고 하다니! 천벌을 받을 거예요!","source_cn":"话说回来，你们又是谁？问这些干嘛！告诉你们又怎样？哼，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD71233888923E992","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322422005:1":{"text":"방해해서 죄송합니다...","source_cn":"对不起，打扰了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13E59ACC40172437","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:唠叨的镇民":{"text":"수다스러운 마을 주민","source":"唠叨的镇民","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}}